# This directory is intentionally empty for now.
#
# It must exist: `Package.swift` declares a `JanelaTerminalTests` target, and
# SwiftPM fails to resolve if the directory is missing. Git does not track empty
# directories, so this file is what keeps it alive across a clone. Delete it once
# there is a real test file here.
#
# What belongs here (see docs/testing.md):
#
#   - `TerminalSession` lifecycle: idle → running → exited, and that `start()` on
#     an already-running session is a no-op.
#   - Laziness: constructing a session allocates no PTY and no emulator. This is
#     the property that makes 40 open tabs viable, so it deserves an explicit test.
#   - Event translation, which is the heart of ADR 0006: feed known byte
#     sequences through the emulator and assert the right `TerminalEventSink`
#     callback fires.
#         BEL          -> terminalDidRequestAttention
#         OSC 0 / 2    -> terminalDidSetTitle
#         OSC 7        -> terminalDidReportWorkingDirectory
#         OSC 9 / 777  -> terminalDidRequestAttention
#         OSC 133 A/C/D-> terminalDidMarkPrompt
#   - Attention badging: a signal while unfocused sets `hasUnseenAttention`;
#     focusing clears it.
